00:07:30.559 --> 00:07:32.000
The room was tidy and clean.

00:07:32.600 --> 00:07:34.239
No signs of a struggle.

00:07:35.200 --> 00:07:37.839
He seemed like a polite guest.

00:07:38.760 --> 00:07:39.959
He came this time

00:07:40.480 --> 00:07:42.760
just to ask about your whereabouts, Shen Changfeng.

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:45.440
He wouldn't press too hard,

00:07:46.279 --> 00:07:47.920
but he wouldn't give up easily either.

00:07:48.440 --> 00:07:49.320
And your grandmother?

00:07:50.079 --> 00:07:51.320
What would she think?

00:07:51.480 --> 00:07:52.559
To protect you,

00:07:53.359 --> 00:07:54.519
what would she do?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:56.440
Some things

00:07:56.959 --> 00:07:58.720
aren't what I wish for either.

00:07:59.720 --> 00:08:02.440
I never thought someone like Brother Changfeng

00:08:03.079 --> 00:08:05.440
would be treasured by someone.

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:07.200
Protected with their life.

00:08:10.480 --> 00:08:11.559
She made an excuse

00:08:12.079 --> 00:08:13.160
and went into the room alone.

00:08:13.640 --> 00:08:15.920
She put on the burial clothes she'd prepared.

00:08:16.760 --> 00:08:17.959
She straightened her clothes

00:08:19.040 --> 00:08:20.359
and quietly set off.

00:08:56.080 --> 00:08:56.840
Eat more.

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:06.239
You child...

00:09:06.239 --> 00:09:07.000
Grandmother.

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.039
I'm sorry.

00:09:12.000 --> 00:09:13.359
You, you...

00:09:13.880 --> 00:09:14.760
It's fine, it's fine.

00:09:18.159 --> 00:09:18.880
Grandmother.

00:09:20.280 --> 00:09:21.239
You rascal.

00:09:22.280 --> 00:09:23.719
Sorry, I'm sorry.

00:09:24.840 --> 00:09:26.479
You rascal.

00:09:27.239 --> 00:09:28.280
Let me lie down too.

00:09:33.159 --> 00:09:34.479
Your grandson is going to join the army.

00:09:35.039 --> 00:09:36.599
I don't know when I'll be back.

00:09:37.119 --> 00:09:37.719
Grandmother.

00:09:39.440 --> 00:09:40.159
I'm sorry.

00:09:40.640 --> 00:09:41.840
Forgive Changfeng for being unfilial.

00:09:43.000 --> 00:09:43.599
Get up.

00:09:47.919 --> 00:09:49.559
You, you...

00:09:52.200 --> 00:09:54.719
You, you...

00:10:04.880 --> 00:10:05.880
Grandmother.

00:10:07.479 --> 00:10:08.559
Grandmother.

00:10:16.000 --> 00:10:17.159
Grandmother.

00:10:26.200 --> 00:10:28.359
Changfeng is sorry to you.

00:10:51.799 --> 00:10:53.679
It's the old lady's spirit and energy.

00:10:54.599 --> 00:10:56.640
But Shen Changfeng,

00:11:02.039 --> 00:11:03.239
