00:11:03.359 --> 00:11:04.559
You still haven't told me

00:11:04.679 --> 00:11:05.559
who killed you,

00:11:05.559 --> 00:11:06.280
who killed Qin Yu,

00:11:06.280 --> 00:11:07.840
and who killed your grandmother.

00:11:07.840 --> 00:11:08.640
Tell me.

00:11:10.440 --> 00:11:11.919
At this point,

00:11:12.159 --> 00:11:13.919
you're still stubborn, aren't you?

00:11:16.039 --> 00:11:17.880
I don't know his identity either.

00:11:20.000 --> 00:11:21.000
He's very mysterious.

00:11:23.039 --> 00:11:25.320
I only know he's a cultivator...

00:11:26.679 --> 00:11:27.320
A cultivator...

00:11:38.559 --> 00:11:39.400
You're here.

00:11:41.479 --> 00:11:42.159
Grandmother.

00:11:44.359 --> 00:11:45.039
I'm sorry.

00:11:47.320 --> 00:11:48.799
You, you...

00:11:48.799 --> 00:11:50.280
Still the same as when you were little.

00:11:59.599 --> 00:12:00.320
Let's go.

00:12:04.000 --> 00:12:04.719
Let's go.

00:12:36.479 --> 00:12:37.159
Fuyi.

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:38.039
What's wrong?

00:12:44.039 --> 00:12:45.239
It's nothing, Fuyi.

00:12:45.520 --> 00:12:46.119
There are others.

00:12:46.119 --> 00:12:47.000
There are other clues.

00:12:47.520 --> 00:12:48.359
There will be more people.

00:13:10.280 --> 00:13:13.479
Last time in the carriage, you said I was seeing things.

00:13:13.880 --> 00:13:14.799
What about yesterday?

00:13:15.239 --> 00:13:17.000
We all saw it with our own eyes.

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:19.280
So...

00:13:21.440 --> 00:13:23.840
Does Xiao Wuzi like you?

00:13:25.440 --> 00:13:26.760
Logically speaking,

00:13:28.679 --> 00:13:29.359
yes.

00:13:29.799 --> 00:13:30.719
I knew it.

00:13:30.960 --> 00:13:31.640
And you?

00:13:52.799 --> 00:13:53.559
I don't know.

00:13:57.919 --> 00:13:58.320
They're here.

00:13:58.320 --> 00:13:59.359
Why is no one here?

00:14:00.919 --> 00:14:01.760
Just like this.

00:14:01.960 --> 00:14:02.880
Who dares to come in?

00:14:03.760 --> 00:14:04.400
Eat quickly.

00:14:14.159 --> 00:14:15.640
Stop making eyes.

00:14:16.039 --> 00:14:18.760
Fuyi doesn't know if she likes you yet.

00:14:23.919 --> 00:14:24.919
Just eat.

00:14:32.039 --> 00:14:33.039
Yesterday.

00:14:38.359 --> 00:14:39.919
How did you get hurt yesterday?

00:14:43.479 --> 00:14:44.280
Are you okay?

00:14:45.039 --> 00:14:46.359
What happened exactly?

00:14:46.919 --> 00:14:47.719
Actually...

00:14:49.479 --> 00:14:50.919
Yesterday, I caught up with that person.

00:14:59.640 --> 00:15:00.880
Why don't you dare to speak?

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.119
Are you afraid I'll hear your voice?

00:15:15.880 --> 00:15:16.400
Chase...

00:15:20.520 --> 00:15:21.679
That person could fly.

00:15:24.719 --> 00:15:26.679
He could overpower you.

00:15:26.840 --> 00:15:28.479
That means his skills are top-notch.

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:31.119
He escaped unharmed from a cliff.

00:15:31.679 --> 00:15:33.479
His agility is also unmatched.

00:15:33.840 --> 00:15:35.159
A master like that

00:15:35.440 --> 00:15:37.239
should be famous across the land.

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:38.400
That's right.

00:15:39.479 --> 00:15:40.719
Such a master

00:15:40.840 --> 00:15:42.359
There are very few in the world.

00:15:42.479 --> 00:15:43.280
I don't know.

00:15:44.719 --> 00:15:46.679
How does he compare to Daoist Yun Yi?

00:15:46.880 --> 00:15:47.719
My master...

00:15:48.760 --> 00:15:50.880
His skills are a bit better than yours,

00:15:51.400 --> 00:15:52.840
